Given typescript (type with leading pipe and ampersand):
  type Foo =
  	| string
  	| number
  	& { a: boolean }
  let x = 3

Do:
  ggVG=

Expect typescript (same indentation):
  type Foo =
  	| string
  	| number
  	& { a: boolean }
  let x = 3

